<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Flow International raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Flow International raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth Inc on Wednesday raised its rating on Flow International Corp to buy from hold, citing improved margins in recent quarters.</p>
<p>Flow International appears to have a good handle on operating issues that have dogged the company since its acquisition of ASI and Dynovation, the firm said.</p>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it also raised its earnings estimate for fiscal 1997 to $0.62 a share from $0.61, given the growth in business and operating margins.</p>
<p>Flow International stock was up 3/16 to 8-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
